<title>BELGIUM: Econocom 1996 profit falls, dividend held.</title>
<headline>Econocom 1996 profit falls, dividend held.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31, 1996 (in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit	    101  vs   119</p>
<p>    Cons sales (billions)   11.04  vs  9.20</p>
<p>    Operating profit	    205  vs   150</p>
<p>    Current profit		115  vs    73</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)	15  vs    15</p>
<p>NOTE - Econocom Group distributes computers and office equipment in the Benelux, France, Britain, Switzerland, Spain and the United States.</p>
<p>In a statement published in Belgian newspapers on Saturday, the group said it planned to spin off part of its computer distribution activities in the middle of 1997. The group said it set aside a 15 million francs provision in its 1996 accounts to cover the cost of this operation.</p>
<p>1997 earnings and sales should improve, it added.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
